#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/canada-crossing-region.df:1226
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/canada-crossing-region.df"
msgid "SHE'S GONNA BLOW!"
msgstr "터진다아!"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/canada-crossing-region.df:1227
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/canada-crossing-region.df"
msgid "EXTREEEEEEMMMMME!"
msgstr "익스트리이이이이임!"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/canada-crossing-region.df:1228
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/canada-crossing-region.df"
msgid "TUCK AND ROLL! OOOOOOF"
msgstr "구르고 굴러! 으윽"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/canada-crossing-region.df:1229
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/canada-crossing-region.df"
msgid "ZOMBIES ARE NEEEEEEERDS!"
msgstr "좀비는 찐따들이야아아아!"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/canada-crossing-region.df:1230
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/canada-crossing-region.df"
msgid "LETS DO THIS!"
msgstr "가자!"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/canada-crossing-region.df:1231
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/canada-crossing-region.df"
msgid "UH WOOPS... MY CAR!"
msgstr "어 이런... 내 차!"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/frozen.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/frozen.df"
msgid "The caveman runs off to enjoy the zombie future."
msgstr "원시인은 좀비 미래를 즐기러 뛰어간다."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/frozen.df:15
#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/frozen.df:23
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/frozen.df"
msgid " teaches "
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/frozen.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/frozen.df"
msgid " some ancient fighting secrets that were lost to time!"
msgstr "에게 시간 속에 잊힌 고대의 싸움 비법을 가르쳐 준다!"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/frozen.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/frozen.df"
msgid "'s MAXIMUM STRENGTH INCREASED!"
msgstr "의 최대 근력 증가!"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/frozen.df:23
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/frozen.df"
msgid " some ancient techniques in medicine and conserving energy!"
msgstr "에게 의술과 체력 아끼는 고대의 기술을 가르쳐 준다!"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/frozen.df:25
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/frozen.df"
msgid "'s MAXIMUM FITNESS INCREASED!"
msgstr "의 최대 체력 증가!"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/frozen.df:33
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/frozen.df"
msgid "Prehistoric Pal"
msgstr "선사시대 친구"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/frozen.df:34
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/frozen.df"
msgid "I overslept! Urghhghhg..."
msgstr "늦잠 잤다! 으어어어..."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/frozen.df:35
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/frozen.df"
msgid "The "
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/frozen.df:35
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/frozen.df"
msgid ""
" doesn't understand the mysterious ways of the future/present, and can't fire guns.\r\n"
"\tShe is capable of "
msgstr ""
"은(는) 미래/현재의 신비한 방식을 이해하지 못하고, 총을 쏠 줄 모른다.\r\n"
"\t대신 이만큼 키울 수 있다: "

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/frozen.df:36
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/frozen.df"
msgid "very high"
msgstr "아주 높은"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/frozen.df:36
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/frozen.df"
msgid ""
" amounts of maximum strength and fitness! She needs several training "
"sessions to reach her full potential."
msgstr " 최대 근력과 체력! 잠재력을 다 끌어내려면 훈련을 여러 번 해야 한다."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/frozen.df:37
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/frozen.df"
msgid "Leave her for now"
msgstr "일단 두고 간다"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/frozen.df:38
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/frozen.df"
msgid "Recruit her to team"
msgstr "일행으로 영입한다"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/frozen.df:39
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/frozen.df"
msgid ": Ask for fighting tips"
msgstr ": 싸움 요령을 묻는다"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/frozen.df:40
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/frozen.df"
msgid ": Ask for survival tips"
msgstr ": 생존 요령을 묻는다"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/frozen.df:45
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/frozen.df"
msgid "Breaking the Ice"
msgstr "얼음 깨기"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/frozen.df:46
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/frozen.df"
msgid ""
"A caveman is frozen in this giant hunk of ice!\r\n"
"\tThere's really no way to get the caveman out without blasting the ice into chunks. Preferably with guns.\r\n"
"\tThis could take awhile, unless you have strong weapons!"
msgstr ""
"원시인이 거대한 얼음덩어리 속에 얼어 있다!\r\n"
"\t얼음을 산산조각 내지 않고서는 원시인을 꺼낼 방법이 없다. 되도록 총으로.\r\n"
"\t강한 무기가 없다면 시간이 좀 걸릴 거다!"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/graveyardcar.df:33
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/graveyardcar.df"
msgid " starts following "
msgstr "은(는) 따라오기 시작한다: "

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/graveyardcar.df:34
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/graveyardcar.df"
msgid " could be useful, if you can get "
msgstr "는 쓸모 있을지도 모른다. 살려서 여기서 데리고 나갈 수만 있다면: "

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/graveyardcar.df:34
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/graveyardcar.df"
msgid " out of here alive. Or a handy distraction, if you can't."
msgstr ". 아니면 쓸 만한 미끼라도 되겠지."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/graveyardcar.df:41
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/graveyardcar.df"
msgid "Undead Undead"
msgstr "죽지 않는 언데드"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/graveyardcar.df:42
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/graveyardcar.df"
msgid " says that "
msgstr "은(는) 말한다. "

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/graveyardcar.df:42
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/graveyardcar.df"
msgid ""
" is tired of being a gravekeeper. Everyone just keeps crawling out of the ground right after they're buried.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"는 묘지기 일에 지쳤다고. 다들 묻히자마자 땅에서 기어 나온다고.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/graveyardcar.df:43
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/graveyardcar.df"
msgid " asks if "
msgstr "는 묻는다. "

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/graveyardcar.df:43
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/graveyardcar.df"
msgid " can follow you around."
msgstr "가 따라가도 되냐고."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/graveyardcar.df:44
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/graveyardcar.df"
msgid "Let "
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/graveyardcar.df:44
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/graveyardcar.df"
msgid " follow you"
msgstr "를 데려간다"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/graveyardcar.df:45
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/graveyardcar.df"
msgid "Leave "
msgstr "일단 "

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/graveyardcar.df:45
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/graveyardcar.df"
msgid " for now"
msgstr "를 두고 간다"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/graveyardcar.df:55
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/graveyardcar.df"
msgid "keeps blasting dark music about vampires and such."
msgstr "은(는) 뱀파이어 같은 어두운 음악을 계속 틀어 댄다."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/road-long.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/road-long.df"
msgid "We're All Out of Death Road"
msgstr "데스 로드는 여기까지다"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/road-long.df:11
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/road-long.df"
msgid "The Mountie's clothing is pristine, despite his zombie slaugtherings."
msgstr "기마경찰의 옷은 좀비를 학살했는데도 티끌 하나 없다."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/road-long.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/road-long.df"
msgid ""
"The Mountie is merely winded. Somehow not even his clothes are ripped from "
"his battle with the zombies."
msgstr "기마경찰은 숨만 조금 찰 뿐이다. 어째선지 좀비와 싸웠는데도 옷 하나 찢어지지 않았다."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/road-long.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/road-long.df"
msgid ""
"WELL, THIS IS ALL WE GOT FOR NOW, EH?\r\n"
"\tCONGRATULATIONS ON WINNING THE ALPHA!"
msgstr ""
"지금은 이게 전부야, 응?\r\n"
"\t알파 클리어를 축하해!"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/road-long.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/road-long.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\tPlease post your feedback so far to Kickstarter, either by direct message or by using the comments section for the last private update."
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t지금까지의 피드백을 킥스타터에 올려 주세요. 메시지로 보내도 되고, 마지막 비공개 업데이트 댓글란을 써도 됩니다."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/region/road-long.df:18
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/region/road-long.df"
msgid "I did it!"
msgstr "해냈다!"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/roadloot.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/roadloot.df"
msgid "Tunnel of Zombs"
msgstr "좀비 터널"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/roadloot.df:11
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/roadloot.df"
msgid ""
" spots a fork in the road leading to a dark tunnel full of wrecked cars. The"
" sounds of undead echo from the entrance."
msgstr "은(는) 망가진 차로 가득한 어두운 터널로 이어지는 갈림길을 발견한다. 입구에서 언데드의 소리가 울린다."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/roadloot.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/roadloot.df"
msgid "Search tunnel"
msgstr "터널을 뒤진다"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/roadloot.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/roadloot.df"
msgid "Convoy on Dirt Road"
msgstr "비포장도로 위의 차량 행렬"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/roadloot.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/roadloot.df"
msgid ""
" sees a bunch of destroyed cars on a dirt road in the distance, surrounded "
"by zombies. It may be worth the risk to walk there and see if there's any "
"loot left."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 멀리 비포장도로 위에 좀비에 둘러싸인 부서진 차 여러 대를 본다. 걸어가서 물자가 남았는지 볼 만한 가치가 있을지도."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/roadloot.df:24
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/roadloot.df"
msgid "Walk to ruined cars"
msgstr "부서진 차까지 걸어간다"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/roadloot.df:29
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/roadloot.df"
msgid "Rocky Road"
msgstr "험한 길"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/roadloot.df:31
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/roadloot.df"
msgid " is travelling down a gravel road when "
msgstr "은(는) 자갈길을 달리고 있다. 그러다 "

#: deathforth/events/exterior/roadloot.df:31
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/roadloot.df"
msgid " come"
msgstr "은(는)"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/roadloot.df:31
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/roadloot.df"
msgid ""
" see a group of wrecked cars ahead, with an undead horde travelling through "
"it."
msgstr " 앞쪽에 부서진 차 무리와, 그 사이를 지나가는 언데드 떼를 본다."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/roadloot.df:34
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/roadloot.df"
msgid "Check out ruined cars"
msgstr "부서진 차를 살펴본다"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/roadloot.df:39
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/roadloot.df"
msgid "Friendly Country Road"
msgstr "정겨운 시골길"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/roadloot.df:41
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/roadloot.df"
msgid ""
" is driving down the highway in a quiet countryside. Up ahead is a big crowd"
" of burnt out cars, with zombies roaming around them."
msgstr "은(는) 조용한 시골 고속도로를 달리고 있다. 앞에 불탄 차들이 잔뜩 모여 있고, 그 주변을 좀비들이 돌아다닌다."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/roadloot.df:44
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/roadloot.df"
msgid "Investigate the cars"
msgstr "차들을 조사한다"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/roadloot.df:49
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/roadloot.df"
msgid "The Mean Street"
msgstr "험악한 거리"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/roadloot.df:51
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/roadloot.df"
msgid " is driving through a city when "
msgstr "은(는) 도시를 지나고 있다. 그러다 "

#: deathforth/events/exterior/roadloot.df:51
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/roadloot.df"
msgid " spot"
msgstr "은(는)"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/roadloot.df:51
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/roadloot.df"
msgid ""
" an intersecting road congested with rusted cars and a horde of already "
"angry zombies."
msgstr " 녹슨 차와 이미 화가 난 좀비 떼로 꽉 막힌 교차로를 발견한다."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/roadloot.df:54
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/roadloot.df"
msgid "Check this side street"
msgstr "이 골목을 살펴본다"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/roadloot.df:59
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/roadloot.df"
msgid "The End of the Death Road"
msgstr "데스 로드의 끝"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/roadloot.df:61
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/roadloot.df"
msgid ""
" has made it to right before the border to Canada!\r\n"
"\tSo close to safety, here's where it gets the most dangerous!"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 캐나다 국경 바로 앞까지 왔다!\r\n"
"\t안전이 코앞인 바로 여기가 가장 위험하다!"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/roadloot.df:65
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/roadloot.df"
msgid "Let's Do This!!!"
msgstr "가자!!!"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df:5
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df"
msgid "Yall-Mart"
msgstr "얄마트"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df"
msgid ""
" spots an abandoned Y'all-Mart off in the distance. It looks like it's been "
"looted, but maybe there's some untouched loot inside."
msgstr "은(는) 멀리 버려진 얄마트를 발견한다. 털린 것 같지만, 안에 손 안 댄 물자가 있을지도."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df:9
#: deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df:54
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df"
msgid "Go bargain hunting"
msgstr "떨이 사냥 간다"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df"
msgid "Grocery Store"
msgstr "식료품점"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df"
msgid ""
" finds a grocery store. Zombies wander inside, as if guarding the remaining "
"food."
msgstr "은(는) 식료품점을 발견한다. 남은 식량을 지키기라도 하듯 좀비들이 안을 서성인다."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df:18
#: deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df:27
#: deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df:36
#: deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df:72
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df"
msgid "Go shopping"
msgstr "장 보러 간다"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df:23
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df"
msgid "Hardware Store"
msgstr "철물점"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df:24
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df"
msgid ""
" finds a hardware store. There may be cans of gas or a chainsaw here, but "
"only if other people haven't picked the place clean yet."
msgstr "은(는) 철물점을 발견한다. 다른 사람들이 싹 털어 가지 않았다면 기름통이나 전기톱이 있을지도."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df:32
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df"
msgid "Grocery Shopping"
msgstr "장보기"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df:33
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df"
msgid ""
" spots a big grocery store. Many zombies roam inside, guarding shelves and "
"storage rooms."
msgstr "은(는) 큰 식료품점을 발견한다. 많은 좀비가 안을 돌아다니며 선반과 창고를 지키고 있다."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df:41
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df"
msgid "Grocery Rescue"
msgstr "식료품점 구출"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df:42
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df"
msgid ""
" watches as another survivor retreats into a big grocery store. The survivor"
" is pursued by a large, angry horde."
msgstr "은(는) 다른 생존자가 큰 식료품점 안으로 도망쳐 들어가는 걸 본다. 생존자는 크고 성난 좀비 떼에게 쫓기고 있다."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df:45
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df"
msgid "Attempt Rescue!"
msgstr "구출을 시도한다!"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df:50
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df"
msgid "Crowded Yall-Mart"
msgstr "붐비는 얄마트"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df:51
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df"
msgid ""
" sees a big Y'all-Mart. A large amount of undead protects the supplies "
"scattered around inside."
msgstr "은(는) 큰 얄마트를 발견한다. 엄청난 수의 언데드가 안에 흩어진 물자를 지키고 있다."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df:59
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df"
msgid "Bookstore Browsing"
msgstr "서점 구경"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df:60
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df"
msgid ""
" sees a large bookstore. Most of the books and magazines have gotten wet and"
" rotted by now, but one here remains in good condition."
msgstr "은(는) 큰 서점을 발견한다. 책과 잡지 대부분은 젖어서 썩었지만, 하나는 상태가 좋다."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df:63
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df"
msgid "Get something to read"
msgstr "읽을거리를 챙긴다"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df:68
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df"
msgid "Sporting Goods Store"
msgstr "스포츠용품점"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df:69
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df"
msgid ""
" spots a large sporting goods store. Many zombies roam inside, likely fallen"
" looters once hunting for a gun or machete."
msgstr "은(는) 큰 스포츠용품점을 발견한다. 많은 좀비가 안을 돌아다닌다. 아마 총이나 마체테를 찾다 쓰러진 약탈자들일 거다."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df:77
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df"
