#: deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df:78
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df"
msgid ""
" spots a big grocery store. Even its parking lot is packed with zombies. Not"
" too many scavengers have been able to get near all the food still inside."
msgstr "은(는) 큰 식료품점을 발견한다. 주차장까지 좀비로 꽉 차 있다. 안에 남은 식량 근처까지 가 본 사람은 별로 없다."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df:81
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df"
msgid "Shop for danger"
msgstr "위험을 쇼핑한다"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df:86
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df"
msgid "Yall-Mart: Deadly Savings"
msgstr "얄마트: 죽음의 할인"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df:87
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df"
msgid ""
" spots a large Yall-Mart packed with zombies. Ignoring the heavy danger, it "
"could be a great shopping experience."
msgstr "은(는) 좀비로 꽉 찬 큰 얄마트를 발견한다. 엄청난 위험만 무시하면, 아주 멋진 쇼핑이 될 수도 있다."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df:90
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df"
msgid "Shop in the stampede"
msgstr "인파 속에서 쇼핑한다"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df:95
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df"
msgid "Untouched Grocery Store"
msgstr "손 안 탄 식료품점"

#: deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df:96
msgctxt "deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df"
msgid ""
"The outbreak in this crowded grocery store happened so fast that the panicked crowd turned into zombies before the place could be looted.\r\n"
"\tMany of the groceries are still on the shelves."
msgstr ""
"붐비는 이 식료품점에서는 좀비 사태가 너무 빨리 일어나, 약탈당하기도 전에 겁에 질린 손님들이 좀비로 변해 버렸다.\r\n"
"\t식료품 상당수가 아직 선반에 있다."

#: deathforth/events/exterior/yallmart.df:100
